  "about": "Incorporated in 2009, Abram Food Ltd produces and trades agro-based products[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Business Overview:[1]\nAFL is engaged in the manufacturing and trading of a wide range of agro-based products, including Chana Dal, Flour (Chakki Atta), Besan, Multi-Grain Atta, Maida, Sooji, Spices, Cattle Feed (Khal), and edible oils. These products are marketed and sold under the brand name Kherliwala across Delhi / NCR, Rajasthan, and Uttar Pradesh through a network of distributors.\nIn addition to retail packs, the company supplies bulk quantities of Chana Dal, Atta, Besan, Chana Churi, and Cattle Feed (Khal) in 30 kg to 50 kg packaging, enabling distributors to cater to end customers through loose sales at retail outlets.",
